<section id="mission">
  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p class="mission-lead">Common Ground Coffee is a nonprofit cafe in Palo Alto where great coffee funds real opportunity. We bring neighbors together over a good cup, and we use every surplus to build pathways out of poverty.</p>
  <p class="mission-note">We are a nonprofit. <strong>100% of surplus funds go to job training</strong> — hands-on barista apprenticeships, resume coaching, and paid placements for people from under-resourced communities. No certifications invented, just honest work, shared tables, and a commitment to keep the doors open for everyone.</p>
</section>"}

